<title>HONG KONG: KDLC unit sets US$30 mln loan.</title>
<headline>KDLC unit sets US$30 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following syndicated loan issue was announced by arranger KDB Asia.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KDLC LEASE AND FINANCE HK LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KOREA DEVELOPMENT LEASING CORPORATION</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$30 MLN   TYPE	TERM LOAN</p>
<p> MARGIN     6ML+60	MATURITY  3 YEARS   AVGE LIFE  --</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	  CALLS     NONE	LAUNCHED  13.JAN.97</p>
<p> DRAWDOWN   MULTIPLE    AVAIL     6 MTHS    REPLIES   3RD WK FEB</p>
<p> REPAYMENT  BULLET	HOME CTRY S.KOREA   GOV LAW   ENGLISH</p>
<p> SOLE ARRANGER    KDB ASIA</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS   US$5 MLN+   36BP  ALL-IN  72</p>
<p>   MANAGERS	     US$3-4 MLN  30BP  ALL-IN  70</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
